            "status": "estimate",
            "value": "stowed: each wing an accordion pack of four 2.8 x 1.05 m folds, turned 90 deg flat against the bus's side face; 5 min (+-15%) after release the packs swing out (3.5 min), then unfold (6.5 min)",
            "source": "Launch layout: CALT via SCMP ('How the launch of China's Guowang satellites differs from its US Starlink rival', 2024-12): two tiers around a central support cylinder, ten per Long March 5B; the fold sequence is an estimate."
